    },
    "メンテナンスや新しい機能など、大事なお知らせを通知でお届けします。オフにしても、ダッシュボードのベルから読めます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We will notify you about important news, such as maintenance and new features. Even when this is off, you can read them from the bell on the dashboard."
