            "value" : "Bug Report"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不具合やご要望、使い方で困ったことがあれば、こちらから運営に送れます。返信もこの画面で確認できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you run into a bug, have a request, or aren’t sure how something works, you can let us know here. Our replies will show up on this screen too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日完了した家事がある日に、決めた時刻にお知らせします。1日の終わりに、家事をふりかえって感謝を伝え合えます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On days when chores get done, we'll notify you at the time you choose. Look back on the day's chores and thank each other."
